{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n荃灣店限定!啖啖芫茜清香\n</p>\n<h2>人氣「阿嬤飯團」新推芫茜雪糕！</h2>\n<p>大癲超震撼！爆紅人氣飯糰雪糕小店「阿嬤飯團」，最近新推出芫茜雪糕，暫時只限荃灣分店供應。芫茜雪糕$29雙球(單味)、$30(兩款口味)，採用新鮮芫茜榨汁而成，雪糕面層鋪滿新鮮芫茜做點綴，雪糕食落有啖啖芫茜清香味，仲有芫茜的顆粒感，芫茜友一定唔好錯過！</p>\n<p>阿嬤飯團<br/>\n地址：荃灣西樓角路202-216號荃昌中心昌寧商場1樓47號舖<br/>\n官方IG：@grannys_riceball</p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506802417747732_13817150306afe90789286a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506802417747732_13817150306afe90789286a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506802621198868_11189281576afe907abb9fa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506802621198868_11189281576afe907abb9fa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506802847360122_1238440766afe907d41256.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506802847360122_1238440766afe907d41256.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506803169938385_20992812066afe90802614e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506803169938385_20992812066afe90802614e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506803369455640_6323037096afe9082a450a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179506803369455640_6323037096afe9082a450a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df6HlJcDtX8/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:23:59.654169+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":422,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:00:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:17:29.110464+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:17:29.110464+00:00","content_hash":"5744dec77e4ac8559f1d8d4101c6865b971bd054514f5d1829163a928033e667","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}